{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16224190","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16224190","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1622419001:1":{"text":"Hepler reveals himself as a massive owlbear. The cats recoil instantly, ears flat, paws sliding backward.","source_cn":"赫普以枭熊的威严样貌现身，野猫们顿时露出惊恐之色，齐齐后退。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81F5155A309F943F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1622419002:0":{"text":"I-It was a routine inspection! To keep intruders under watch... We didn't know you were here, Lord <style=\"highlight\">Woodkeeper</style>. Our apologies!","source_cn":"我、我们只是例行巡查，怕有外来者破坏森林的秩序……不知...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DC9D9EEECBE1912","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1622419003:0":{"text":"Forgive us. We'll be gone immediately...","source_cn":"是、是我们冒犯了，我们……我们这就走……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79FD5DD1A3489A56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1622419004:0":{"text":"Hepler says nothing. He simply watches as the cats scatter into the trees. Awestruck, the flock looks at him.","source_cn":"赫普沉默未语，目送猫群仓皇散去，消失在林间。在场的候鸟...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90414C1E37D62057","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1622419005:1":{"text":"Chirp! What a lifesaver! Thank you! ","source_cn":"啾！是您帮了我们！太感谢了！您真是我们的大恩人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD96F4F35D4CA7246","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1622419006:1":{"text":"Y-You are Lord Woodkeeper?","source_cn":"您……您是林息者大人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BAC9684D5ECCB32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1622419007:1":{"text":"No, I'm not.","source_cn":"你认错了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3160E32AF350B181","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1622419007":{"text":"No, I'm not.","source_cn":"你认错了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3160E32AF350B181","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1622419008:1":{"text":"A powerful, mysterious...","source_cn":"那是一个强大而神秘的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02B0D98E52BBE52C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1622419009:1":{"text":"Serka is cut off as a bird comes flapping in.","source_cn":"瑟卡还未说完，一只候鸟惊慌失措地向你们飞来。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5FE3A963221F2416","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Serka is cut off as a bird comes flapping in.","female":"Serka is cut off as a bird comes flapping in.","variant_male_record_index":"217621","variant_female_record_index":"217622","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1622419010:1":{"text":"Bad news! Serka! One of the chicks bolted when that happened. It's gone!","source_cn":"不好了！瑟卡！刚才的动静把几只幼鸟吓散了，现在不知道飞...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50328534E5091D7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1622419011:1":{"text":"I'll get it back!","source_cn":"我去把它们找回来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11E93E26A50CFB59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1622419012:1":{"text":"Serka tries to move, but his wing fails him and he nearly goes down. He can't take off like this.","source_cn":"瑟卡刚迈出一步，便因翅膀的伤势踉跄了一下，显然已无力飞行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE693F98D740EB3E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1622419012":{"text":"Serka tries to move, but his wing fails him and he nearly goes down. He can't take off like this.","source_cn":"瑟卡刚迈出一步，便因翅膀的伤势踉跄了一下，显然已无力飞行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE693F98D740EB3E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female"